  "solution": "Xét các biến cố \n\t\t<ul class=\"\"><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Con heo bị nhiễm bệnh””.</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Con heo có kết quả dương tính””.</li></ul>\n\t\tTrong đàn heo có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> con nhiễm bệnh và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>55</mn></semantics></math> con không nhiễm bệnh nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>55</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>11</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đối với heo nhiễm bệnh, xác suất xét nghiệm dương tính là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><